"file_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BRszXqPGODcQ7kNvwHnkqGm&_nc_oc=AdqgUoACkHxNKMIkHCAp72qIaD3fpBoDcbUpoRWc256MACf-knJGvGKBMCuqbI4P674&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-FMF_eMOA_UokzxflFaTN9EWSPYwJAWh-d0O9wML0Qzw&oe=6A394FF9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tOuR0jGNtRcQ7kNvwHizNLd&_nc_oc=AdpzLQGHS1_59LE_qvgG6K1achjRSt4jSyBj8oua5GPXGa0Z_fSpyiJAQFMiBCejIwk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_livtkRGS3foGvvpkePOWrNm3gRJvuUNhqNw3Eu7XdGw&oe=6A395F93"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3wQNqewDr-kQ7kNvwHD4Try&_nc_oc=AdrMNO1KdkTY6L8By37oFinqWX-ioZT7NvcObyJi7G26x-1GC7iEXy5khQ8sNFcNt4o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-8GHSZicaMLnk3dMJQf8BNLUYvDsQOCJgPhYX90QPqBg&oe=6A3932FB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nPSgj5gaFXIQ7kNvwHBrnE1&_nc_oc=AdoycqejeHMgn450RkGB57Zlc-UYWPV8aaVoqTLl6UdXFS4TCI2-vrFnc_ZbHpSfhI8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8DyfL6YX47KwM4D16nCrJP9Il1J9PnlRRXvznZ7Jgmhg&oe=6A39344A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6tVDCTbgz4AQ7kNvwHqHbir&_nc_oc=AdobptvjpCB3qdWuLhnjPYIMds5EIWhPnQO1l-fiLyHobIMb9DpQj8rFmUlxyEasdu4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9hAwDcxHGf4G4Avc0iJpN200lb57u0QuMG_i0FwaXhYQ&oe=6A3955BE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_ter